build-app: reused /home/epentland/.cache/mylang/workbench/projects/pcb-workbench/builds/9c9fbea2db46e904acd42d313a402a28d70538c0aa6539bd006e85b79e87a978/pcb-workbench
pcb-workbench — build a PCB layout through explicit geometry edits

usage: pcb-workbench <command> [options]

  kit         extract the frozen problem kit from the design sources
  status      report the frozen problem and the current candidate
  observe     read the circuit, geometry and open connections
  probe       local measurements and the limits that apply
  evaluate    run the referee and print the measured report
  render      write a PNG view of the current candidate
  finish      fully validate, serialize and recheck the candidate
  recall      retrieve related experiments from the journal
  note        attach reasoning to a recorded trial
  checkpoint  retain the current candidate under a label
  restore     return to an earlier revision

common options
  --kit PATH        problem kit JSON (default kit/black-canyon.kit.json)
  --journal DIR     journal root (default .pcb-workbench)
